        children: "flowchart TB\n    U[User] --> R[Router Agent]\n    R --> OA[Orders Agent]\n    R --> RA[Refunds Agent]\n    R --> FA[FAQ Agent]\n    R --> SA[Support Agent]\n    OA --> T[Tools: Lookup/Cancel]\n    RA --> T2[Tools: Refund/Return]\n    FA --> T3[Tools: Knowledge Base]\n    OA --> E[Escalation]\n    RA --> E\n    FA --> E\n    E --> H[Human Agent]\n    OA --> M[Shared Memory]\n    RA --> M\n    FA --> M\n"
